@page
@{ ViewData["Title"]="Sustainability"; }
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Sustainability</span><h1>Giving technology a responsible second life</h1><p>Reuse and refurbishment come first. Responsible recycling supports material recovery when reuse is no longer possible.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4 reveal"><div class="feature-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i></div><h3>Reuse</h3><p>Usable assets are evaluated for redeployment, resale or donation rather than immediate disposal.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4 reveal"><div class="feature-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i></div><h3>Refurbish</h3><p>Repair, testing and component upgrades extend product life and improve value recovery.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4 reveal"><div class="feature-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-recycle"></i></div><h3>Recycle</h3><p>Non-reusable materials are routed through responsible processing channels for material recovery.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
